This repository provides data preparation and full-parameter supervised
fine-tuning code for NVIDIA Nemotron-3.5-Super.

Training is driven by NVIDIA NeMo Automodel:
  https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel

patches/nemotron35-super-automodel.patch is based on Automodel commit
8cb12a35b65eda421d8f1fa485c658eb06d22c76. NVIDIA copyright and Apache-2.0
notices in the upstream sources remain applicable.

Model weights, model-provided remote code, and training datasets are not
included. The example conversations are synthetic schema illustrations.
